# <<< loom-managed <<<

# Foreign lockfiles. package.json declares packageManager pnpm@11.20.0, so a
# package-lock.json or yarn.lock here is an accident (someone ran the wrong
# install) — one appeared and rewrote a dependency pin before anyone noticed.
# Ignoring them makes the mistake harmless instead of committable.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Tool logs, same rule as .loom/logs/ above.
.claude/skills/repo/logs/
